{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "badge",
	"title": "Badge 徽标",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "简短的状态、分类或计数标签。",
	"devDependencies": [
		"tailwind-variants@^3.3.0"
	],
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"徽标",
				"badge",
				"标签",
				"状态",
				"tag"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"显示状态、分类或数量",
				"用 href 渲染为链接"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "用户输入、可删除的多个标签",
					"use": "tags-input"
				},
				{
					"case": "需要说明的提示信息",
					"use": "alert"
				},
				{
					"case": "可点击的操作",
					"use": "button"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"含义要用文字表达，不能只靠颜色",
				"作为链接时文字要说明去向"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"文字保持简短，避免换行"
			],
			"related": [
				"button",
				"tags-input",
				"avatar"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Badge 设计规范\n\n- 用于状态、分类、计数等简短标记；用 `variant` 选择用途相符的样式。\n- 已应用的问题标签用 `variant=\"label\"`。胶囊高 24 px，左右留白 8 px，文字 12 px／450。可传入标签数据中的 `labelColor`，在 14 px 标记位内绘制 9 px 圆点，和文字相隔 6 px。浅深色沿用 My issues 实测值，描边为 0.5 CSS px，设备像素对齐由浏览器处理。\n- 标签的描边色、文字色和底色过渡为 150 ms。开启系统的减少动态效果后即时切换。\n- Badge 不是按钮：需要点击执行操作时用 `Button size=\"xs\"` 等小号按钮；需要跳转时给 Badge 设 `href`，它会渲染为链接。\n- 文字保持一两个词；用颜色表示状态时文字本身也要说明状态（“已失败”），不要只靠颜色。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "badge/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\" module>\n\timport { type VariantProps, tv } from \"tailwind-variants\";\n\n\texport const badgeVariants = tv({\n\t\tbase: \"h-5 gap-1 rounded-4xl border border-transparent px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium transition-all has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&>svg]:size-3! group/badge inline-flex w-fit shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&>svg]:pointer-events-none\",\n\t\tvariants: {\n\t\t\tvariant: {\n\t\t\t\tdefault: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground [a]:hover:bg-primary/80\",\n\t\t\t\tsecondary: \"bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground [a]:hover:bg-secondary/80\",\n\t\t\t\tdestructive: \"bg-destructive/10 [a]:hover:bg-destructive/20 focus-visible:ring-destructive/20 dark:focus-visible:ring-destructive/40 text-destructive dark:bg-destructive/20\",\n\t\t\t\toutline: \"border-border text-foreground [a]:hover:bg-muted [a]:hover:text-muted-foreground\",\n\t\t\t\tghost: \"hover:bg-muted hover:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-muted/50\",\n\t\t\t\tlink: \"text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline\",\n\t\t\t\tlabel: \"h-6 gap-1.5 rounded-full border-[0.5px] border-[color:lch(84.44%_0_282)] bg-[lch(97.94%_0.5_282)] px-2 py-0 text-[color:lch(39.176%_1.25_282)] font-[450] transition-[border-color,color,background-color] duration-150 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2 has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2 motion-reduce:transition-none dark:border-[color:lch(16.32%_1.48_272)] dark:bg-[lch(5.52%_0.4_272)] dark:text-[color:lch(61.803%_1.2_272)]\",\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tdefaultVariants: {\n\t\t\tvariant: \"default\",\n\t\t},\n\t});\n\n\texport type BadgeVariant = VariantProps<typeof badgeVariants>[\"variant\"];\n</script>\n\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAnchorAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\thref,\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tvariant = \"default\",\n\t\tlabelColor,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAnchorAttributes> & {\n\t\tvariant?: BadgeVariant;\n\t\tlabelColor?: string;\n\t} = $props();\n</script>\n\n<svelte:element\n\tthis={href ? \"a\" : \"span\"}\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"badge\"\n\t{href}\n\tclass={cn(badgeVariants({ variant }), className)}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{#if variant === \"label\" && labelColor}\n\t\t<span\n\t\t\taria-hidden=\"true\"\n\t\t\tdata-slot=\"badge-label-marker\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"grid size-3.5 shrink-0 place-items-center before:size-[9px] before:rounded-full before:bg-current\"\n\t\t\tstyle:color={labelColor}\n\t\t></span>\n\t{/if}\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</svelte:element>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "badge/badge.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "export { default as Badge } from \"./badge.svelte\";\nexport { badgeVariants, type BadgeVariant } from \"./badge.svelte\";\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "badge/index.ts"
		}
	]
}